DorkCombat started as a fork of CelestCombat by Nighter, released under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (https://hangar.papermc.io/Nighter/CelestCombat). Parts of its
combat-tag logic, including the explosion-location fallback for end-crystal
tagging, came from that project by way of the CelestCombat-Xtra fork.

You may share and adapt DorkCombat if you:
  - give credit to Nighter (CelestCombat) and aliensockpuppet (DorkCombat),
  - do not use it for commercial purposes, and
  - release your changes under the same license.

The rest of the Dork suite is MIT licensed. See the LICENSE file at the root of
the repository. This file applies only to the backend/DorkCombat folder.
